      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mineola%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mineola’s vibrant Portuguese community, visible in local cuisine and businesses, has shaped the village’s cultural identity for decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
